{"pageid":2600,"title":"4-Way Conveyor","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">4-Way Conveyor</span>","revid":15797,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">4-Way Conveyor</h2>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alan's AutoLogistics</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$680</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Conveyor belt that goes in 4 different directions</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p>The 4 Way Conveyor can be used as a single <a href=\"/wiki/Straight_Conveyor\" title=\"Straight Conveyor\">Conveyor</a> except it can move any object at all 4 directions. This has no square box to connect to any <a href=\"/wiki/Logic\" title=\"Logic\">logic</a> structures. It can however be switched directions by an <a href=\"/wiki/Interactor\" title=\"Interactor\">interactor</a> like other <a href=\"/wiki/Straight_Conveyor\" title=\"Straight Conveyor\">conveyors</a>. \n</p><p>When facing the conveyor's direction switch and connecting an <a href=\"/wiki/Interactor\" title=\"Interactor\">interactor</a> to switch direction with power outputs, use these numbers as outputs:\n</p><p>Output of 0 - RIGHT \n</p><p>Output of 2 - LEFT \n</p><p>Output of 8 - BACK \n</p><p>Output of 10 - FRONT \n</p><p>There is also a direction for the <a href=\"/wiki/Straight_Conveyor\" title=\"Straight Conveyor\">conveyor</a> to not move ( also like other <a href=\"/wiki/Straight_Conveyor\" title=\"Straight Conveyor\">conveyors</a> ) , though it does not appear to have an input value.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260828072107\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019494/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time 